  "description": "ScoreRS is a learned quality scoring model for automated assessment and curation of remote sensing vision-language data, trained on large-scale RS-specific preference datasets. It enables quality-driven data selection, RL reward modeling, and best-of-N test-time scaling for VLMs in remote sensing.",
